armGroups.description:
Online grocer delivery fee waiver and a tutorial video addressing digital literacy will be constant components, meaning that it will be available to all participants in the study. Plus:

1. weekly text messages to improve the trust in online grocery services;
2. weekly match-up to $10 as a financial incentive for purchasing FVL online targeting loss aversion;
3. weekly instant shoppable grocery lists of culturally tailored meal suggestions using SNAP recipes targeted at impulse purchases.

